<title>USA: Southwest Securities completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Southwest Securities completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Securities Group Inc said Friday that it has completed the acquisition of privately-held Equity Securities Trading Company Inc, an NASD broker/dealer engaged in the securities clearing business.</p>
<p>The transaction, which the company said was accomplished through an exchange of stock, closed on May 1. Details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Southwest Securities is a Dallas-based holding company that provides fully disclosed securities clearing and related services, as well as securities brokerage, investment banking and asset management services.</p>
</text>
